{"id":"5e2485d60abdf08e","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-TB-plus.md","title":"TB加与原书全归纳 TB 的对应","display":"df-TB-plus — TB加与原书全归纳 TB 的对应","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-TB-plus","aliases":["91-df-TB-plus","91-df-TB^+"],"display":"df-TB-plus — TB加与原书全归纳 TB 的对应","depends_on":["[[91-df-TB]]","[[91-df-induction-schema]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-TB-plus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-TB-plus</span><span>91-df-TB^+</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-TB-plus — TB加与原书全归纳 TB 的对应"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6018cc1b13710826\" href=\"?note=6018cc1b13710826\" title=\"91-df-TB\">91-df-TB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span> 为经典一阶演绎闭包。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB}\">\\(\\mathrm{TB}\\)</span> 已按原书包含完整 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6018cc1b13710826\" href=\"?note=6018cc1b13710826\" title=\"91-df-TB\">91-df-TB</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}TB\\text{-}plus}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{TB}^{+}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{TB}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T})=\\mathrm{TB}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}TB\\text{-}plus}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{TB}^{+}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{TB}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T})=\\mathrm{TB}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留旧文件及记号以免破坏链接；在本次原书对齐后，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\">\\(+\\)</span> 不再表示一个新的更强理论。\n旧版的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB}^{+}\">\\(\\mathrm{TB}^{+}\\)</span> 实质对应原书 TB；旧版的 TB 对应原书受限归纳版本。完整归纳的 TB 仍算术保守。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 7.1、7.3 与 Theorem 7.5，印刷页 53–56，PDF 页 64–67。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-TB","status":"resolved","id":"6018cc1b13710826","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-TB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"09791de618b277ba","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-induction-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-TB","status":"resolved","id":"6018cc1b13710826","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TB}$ 已按原书包含完整 $\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}$，见 [[91-df-TB]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TB}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}TB\\text{-}plus}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{TB}^{+}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{TB}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T})=\\mathrm{TB}.","display":true},{"tex":"+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TB}^{+}","display":false}],"bytes":1056,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-39","locat